            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.14+1KI.10.15+1KI.10.16+1KI.10.17+1KI.10.18+1KI.10.19+1KI.10.20+1KI.10.21+1KI.10.22+1KI.10.23+1KI.10.24+1KI.10.25+1KI.10.26+1KI.10.27+1KI.10.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 10:14-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazahabu yaza kwa Salomo mu mwaka mu mwaka, ukuriba kwayo kwashika italanto amajana atandatu na mirongwitandatu na zitandatu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.72.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 72:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "udashizekw ayo abahanjuzi n’abadandaza bāzana; kand’ abami bose bo muri Arabiya n’abaganza igihugu bāzanira Salomo amazahabu n’amafeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umwami Salomo acurisha inkinzo nini‐nini amajana abiri mw izahabu, imwe‐imwe yacurwa mw izahabu irivye shekeli amajana atandatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acurisha n’inkinzo nto‐nto amajana atatu mw izahabu nyene, imwe‐imwe yacurwa mw izahabu irivye shekeli amajana atatu; umwami azishira muri ya nzu yitwa iy’ Ikibira c’i Lebanoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ umwami yibāzishiriza intebe nini y’ubgami mu mahembe y’inzovu, ayomekakw izahabu iramuye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo ntebe yar’ ifise aho kudondagira hatandatu, n’agatebe ko gushirakw ibirenge gacuzwe mw izahabu, gafatanijwe n’iyo ntebe; kand’ impande zompi z’icicaro cayo yar’ ifise aho gushirakw amaboko, n’ibishushanyo bibiri vy’intambge, kimwe gihagaze ku ruhande rumwe, ikindi ku rundi rw’ahashirwa amaboko nyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi hār’ ibishushanyo vy’intambge cumi na bibiri, bidondagije kimwe‐kimwe impande zompi z’aho kudondagira ukw ari hatandatu; mu bihugu vyose nta ntebe y’ubgami yigeze kubāzwa ihwanye n’iyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kand’ ibintu vyose vy’umwami Salomo vyo kunywesha vyar’ ivy’ izahabu, n’ibikoreshwa vyose vyo mur’ iyo nzu yitwa iy’ Ikibira c’i Lebanoni vyar’ ivy’ izahabu iramuye; kuko ku ngoma ya Salomo ifeza ata co bāyiyumvirako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.20.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 20:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.20.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ umwami yar’ afise amāto aja i Tarushishi, ajanwa n’abantu ba Huramu; ukw imyaka itatu ishize, ayo māto y’i Tarushishi yagaruka azanye amazahabu n’ amafeza n’amahembe y’inzovu n’ inkima n’ibisīga vyitwa tawusi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uko ni k’ umwami Salomo yarusha abami bose bo mw isi ubutunzi n’ubgenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu bihugu vyose vyo mw isi hāhora haza abami bagomba kubona Salomo, no kwumva ivyo avugishwa n’ubgenge Imana yashize mu mutima wiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu wese muri bo yaza azanye indamukanyo, ar’ ivyakozwe mu mafeza canke mu mazahabu, ar’ ivyambarwa, ar’ ibirwanishwa, ar’ imibavu, ar’ amafarasi, ar’ inyumbu; ni ko vyagenda uk’ umwaka utashe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.1.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 1:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Salomo yar’ afise impongore ibihumbi bine z’amafarasi yakwega imikogote yiwe, n’abantu bagendera ku mafarasi ibihumbi cumi na bibiri, bamwe abashira mu bisagara bibīkwamw’ imikogote, abandi i we i Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.4.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 4:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.72.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 72:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yaganza abami bose, uhereye kuri rwa ruzi Efurate, ugashitsa ku gihugu c’Abafilisitiya, ukagarukira ku rubibe rwa Egiputa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.1.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 1:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwami, amafeza yararushe ayahindura nk’ amabuye i Yerusalemu, n’ibiti vy’amasederi bihinduka nk’ivy’ imisukomora vyo mu biyaya mu kuba vyinshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 1:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi bāzanira Salomo amafarasi bayakūye muri Egiputa no mu bindi bihugu vyose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
